{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "mogi-complete-api-v2",
    "name": "🍄 MOGI Complete API",
    "description": "Koleksi lengkap API MOGI (Mushroom Optimal Growth Intelligence)\n\n## Alur Penggunaan\n\n1. **Authentication** - Register & Login untuk mendapatkan token\n2. **Device Management** - Setup dan registrasi device IoT\n3. **Temperature Monitoring** - Kirim dan pantau data sensor\n4. **ML Inference** - Dapatkan prediksi waktu panen dan risiko\n5. **Device Control** - Kontrol Arduino dengan session PIN\n\n## Setup Environment Variables\n\nSetelah import, pastikan set variable berikut:\n- `base_url`: http://localhost:3000\n- `accessToken`: (didapat dari Login)\n- `refreshToken`: (didapat dari Login)\n- `sessionToken`: (didapat dari Device Auth)\n- `deviceCode`: Kode device Anda",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "refreshToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "sessionToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "deviceCode",
      "value": "ESP32-001",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "devicePin",
      "value": "123456",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1️⃣ Authentication",
      "description": "Endpoint untuk registrasi, login, dan refresh token.\n\n**Urutan:**\n1. Register (sekali saja untuk user baru)\n2. Login (untuk mendapatkan accessToken)\n3. Refresh Token (saat token expired)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register User",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    pm.test('Registration successful', function() {",
                  "        var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "        pm.expect(json.message).to.equal('User successfully registered');",
                  "        pm.expect(json.user).to.have.property('id');",
                  "    });",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"petani@jamur.com\",\n    \"password\": \"password123\",\n    \"name\": \"Pak Tani\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Mendaftarkan user baru ke sistem MOGI.\n\n**Kegunaan:** Membuat akun untuk mengakses semua fitur API.\n\n**Kapan digunakan:** Sekali saja saat pertama kali menggunakan sistem."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', json.accessToken);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', json.refreshToken);",
                  "    ",
                  "    pm.test('Login successful', function() {",
                  "        pm.expect(json.accessToken).to.be.a('string');",
                  "        pm.expect(json.refreshToken).to.be.a('string');",
                  "    });",
                  "    ",
                  "    console.log('✅ Token saved to collection variables');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"petani@jamur.com\",\n    \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login untuk mendapatkan access token.\n\n**Kegunaan:** Mendapatkan JWT token untuk mengakses endpoint yang memerlukan autentikasi.\n\n**Kapan digunakan:** Setiap kali memulai session baru atau setelah logout.\n\n**Auto-save:** Token akan otomatis tersimpan ke collection variables."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', json.accessToken);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', json.refreshToken);",
                  "    ",
                  "    pm.test('Token refreshed', function() {",
                  "        pm.expect(json.accessToken).to.be.a('string');",
                  "    });",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/refresh",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "refresh"]
            },
            "description": "Memperbarui access token yang sudah expired.\n\n**Kegunaan:** Mendapatkan token baru tanpa perlu login ulang.\n\n**Kapan digunakan:** Saat access token expired (biasanya setelah 1 jam)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2️⃣ Device Management",
      "description": "Endpoint untuk mengelola device IoT (Arduino/ESP32).\n\n**Alur Setup Device Baru:**\n1. Create Device (Admin) - Buat device di database\n2. Check Status - Cek apakah device tersedia\n3. Register Device - Claim ownership dengan PIN\n\n**Alur Penggunaan Harian:**\n1. My Devices - Lihat daftar device\n2. Get Details - Lihat detail device tertentu\n3. Connect - Verifikasi kepemilikan dengan PIN",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Device (Admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"deviceCode\": \"ESP32-001\",\n    \"name\": \"Sensor Kumbung A\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/device/create",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "device", "create"]
            },
            "description": "Membuat device baru di sistem (endpoint admin).\n\n**Kegunaan:** Mendaftarkan device baru ke database sebelum bisa di-claim oleh user.\n\n**Kapan digunakan:** Sekali saja saat setup device baru oleh admin.\n\n**⚠️ Catatan:** Di production, endpoint ini harus dilindungi dengan admin auth."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Check Device Status",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/device/status/{{deviceCode}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "device", "status", "{{deviceCode}}"]
            },
            "description": "Mengecek status device (tersedia atau sudah dimiliki).\n\n**Kegunaan:** Melihat apakah device bisa di-claim sebelum registrasi.\n\n**Kapan digunakan:** Sebelum mencoba register device."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Register Device (Claim)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{accessToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"deviceCode\": \"{{deviceCode}}\",\n    \"pin\": \"{{devicePin}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/device/register",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "device", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Meng-claim device dan mengatur PIN.\n\n**Kegunaan:** Menjadi pemilik device dan mengamankan dengan PIN.\n\n**Kapan digunakan:** Sekali saat pertama kali setup device."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get My Devices",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{accessToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/device/my-devices",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "device", "my-devices"]
            },
            "description": "Mendapatkan daftar semua device yang dimiliki user.\n\n**Kegunaan:** Melihat semua device yang sudah di-register.\n\n**Kapan digunakan:** Untuk menampilkan daftar device di aplikasi."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Device Details",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{accessToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/device/{{deviceCode}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "device", "{{deviceCode}}"]
            },
            "description": "Mendapatkan detail lengkap satu device.\n\n**Kegunaan:** Melihat informasi detail device tertentu.\n\n**Kapan digunakan:** Saat membuka halaman detail device."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Connect to Device",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{accessToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"deviceCode\": \"{{deviceCode}}\",\n    \"pin\": \"{{devicePin}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/device/connect",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "device", "connect"]
            },
            "description": "Verifikasi PIN untuk mengakses device.\n\n**Kegunaan:** Memverifikasi kepemilikan device.\n\n**Kapan digunakan:** Sebelum mengakses data atau mengontrol device."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Device Name",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{accessToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"deviceCode\": \"{{deviceCode}}\",\n    \"name\": \"Sensor Kumbung Utama\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/device/update-name",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "device", "update-name"]
            },
            "description": "Mengubah nama device.\n\n**Kegunaan:** Memberikan nama yang lebih deskriptif.\n\n**Kapan digunakan:** Saat ingin mengubah identifikasi device."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Change Device PIN",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{accessToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"deviceCode\": \"{{deviceCode}}\",\n    \"oldPin\": \"{{devicePin}}\",\n    \"newPin\": \"654321\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/device/change-pin",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "device", "change-pin"]
            },
            "description": "Mengubah PIN device.\n\n**Kegunaan:** Meningkatkan keamanan dengan mengganti PIN.\n\n**Kapan digunakan:** Secara berkala atau jika PIN diketahui orang lain."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Forget Device (Release)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{accessToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"deviceCode\": \"{{deviceCode}}\",\n    \"pin\": \"{{devicePin}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/device/forget",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "device", "forget"]
            },
            "description": "Melepas kepemilikan device.\n\n**Kegunaan:** Agar device bisa di-claim user lain.\n\n**Kapan digunakan:** Saat menjual atau memberikan device ke orang lain."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3️⃣ Temperature Monitoring",
      "description": "Endpoint untuk menerima dan memantau data sensor suhu/kelembaban.\n\n**Alur:**\n1. Send Temperature Data - Arduino mengirim data sensor\n2. Get State - Lihat konfigurasi monitoring\n3. Update Config - Sesuaikan threshold dan interval\n\n**Catatan:**\n- Data disimpan ke database setiap 30 menit atau saat ada lonjakan\n- Data juga di-broadcast via WebSocket ke semua client yang terhubung",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Send Temperature Data",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{accessToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"temperature\": 26.5,\n    \"humidity\": 85.0\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/temperature/data",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "temperature", "data"]
            },
            "description": "Endpoint utama untuk Arduino/ESP32 mengirim data sensor.\n\n**Kegunaan:** Menerima data suhu dan kelembaban dari sensor IoT.\n\n**Kapan digunakan:** Secara berkala oleh Arduino (misal setiap 1 menit).\n\n**Perilaku:**\n- Data selalu di-broadcast via WebSocket\n- Disimpan ke DB jika interval 30 menit tercapai ATAU ada lonjakan"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Send Bulk Data (Testing)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{accessToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"data\": [\n        { \"temperature\": 25.0, \"humidity\": 80.0 },\n        { \"temperature\": 25.5, \"humidity\": 81.0 },\n        { \"temperature\": 26.0, \"humidity\": 82.0 },\n        { \"temperature\": 26.5, \"humidity\": 83.0 },\n        { \"temperature\": 27.0, \"humidity\": 84.0 },\n        { \"temperature\": 27.5, \"humidity\": 85.0 }\n    ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/temperature/bulk",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "temperature", "bulk"]
            },
            "description": "Mengirim banyak data sekaligus untuk testing.\n\n**Kegunaan:** Testing spike detection dan bulk processing.\n\n**Kapan digunakan:** Development dan testing saja."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Monitoring State",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{accessToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/temperature/state",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "temperature", "state"]
            },
            "description": "Mendapatkan state monitoring saat ini.\n\n**Kegunaan:** Melihat konfigurasi dan data terakhir.\n\n**Return:**\n- threshold: Selisih untuk trigger lonjakan\n- saveIntervalMinutes: Interval simpan regular\n- lastSavedAt: Waktu terakhir disimpan ke DB\n- lastData: Data sensor terakhir"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Monitoring Config",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{accessToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"threshold\": 3.0,\n    \"saveIntervalMinutes\": 15\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/temperature/config",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "temperature", "config"]
            },
            "description": "Mengubah konfigurasi monitoring.\n\n**Kegunaan:** Menyesuaikan sensitivitas dan frekuensi penyimpanan.\n\n**Parameter:**\n- threshold: Selisih suhu/kelembaban yang dianggap lonjakan (default: 2.0)\n- saveIntervalMinutes: Interval penyimpanan regular dalam menit (default: 30)"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Reset Monitoring State",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{accessToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/temperature/reset",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "temperature", "reset"]
            },
            "description": "Mereset state monitoring ke default.\n\n**Kegunaan:** Mengembalikan konfigurasi ke nilai awal.\n\n**Kapan digunakan:** Saat ingin memulai monitoring dari awal."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4️⃣ ML Inference & Prediction",
      "description": "Endpoint untuk prediksi Machine Learning.\n\n**Alur Rekomendasi:**\n1. Pastikan sudah ada data sensor (minimal 1 jam data)\n2. Gunakan Full Prediction untuk mendapatkan prediksi lengkap\n3. Lihat History untuk analisis trend\n\n**Fitur Prediksi:**\n- 🌾 Waktu Panen - Prediksi kapan jamur siap panen\n- ⚠️ Risiko Gagal - Level risiko gagal panen\n- 🚨 Anomali - Deteksi pembacaan sensor tidak normal\n- 💡 Rekomendasi - Saran untuk optimasi pertumbuhan",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Full Prediction (Recommended)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{accessToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"deviceId\": \"ESP32-001\",\n    \"baglogCount\": 200,\n    \"hoursBack\": 24\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/inference/predict",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "inference", "predict"]
            },
            "description": "Prediksi lengkap dengan agregasi data sensor real-time.\n\n**Kegunaan:** Mendapatkan prediksi panen, risiko, dan anomali.\n\n**Parameter:**\n- deviceId: Filter berdasarkan device (opsional)\n- baglogCount: Jumlah baglog jamur (default: 100)\n- hoursBack: Jam data yang diagregasi (default: 24)\n\n**Return:**\n- prediksiPanen: Estimasi hari dan tanggal panen\n- risikoGagal: Level dan probabilitas risiko\n- anomali: Deteksi pembacaan tidak normal\n- rekomendasi: Saran untuk petani\n- kondisiSaatIni: Ringkasan kondisi lingkungan"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Predict from Stored Features",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{accessToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"deviceId\": \"ESP32-001\",\n    \"baglogCount\": 200\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/inference/predict-stored",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "inference", "predict-stored"]
            },
            "description": "Prediksi menggunakan fitur yang sudah di-compute.\n\n**Kegunaan:** Prediksi lebih cepat tanpa agregasi ulang.\n\n**Kapan digunakan:** Jika sudah pernah compute-features sebelumnya."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Compute & Store Features",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{accessToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"deviceId\": \"ESP32-001\",\n    \"windowType\": \"hourly\",\n    \"baglogCount\": 200\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/inference/compute-features",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "inference", "compute-features"]
            },
