    {
      "name": "5️⃣ Device Control & Session",
      "description": "Endpoint untuk mengontrol device dengan sistem session berbasis PIN.\n\n**Alur Kontrol Device:**\n1. Auth Device - Autentikasi dengan PIN, dapat session token (5 menit)\n2. Send Control - Kirim perintah ke Arduino\n3. Check Status - Cek sisa waktu session\n4. Extend Session - Perpanjang jika perlu\n5. Logout - Akhiri session\n\n**⚠️ Penting:**\n- Session berlaku 5 menit untuk keamanan\n- Setelah expired, harus auth ulang dengan PIN\n- Header X-Device-Session wajib untuk endpoint control",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Authenticate Device (Get Session)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('sessionToken', json.session.token);",
                  "    ",
                  "    pm.test('Session token received', function() {",
                  "        pm.expect(json.session.token).to.be.a('string');",
                  "    });",
                  "    ",
                  "    console.log('✅ Session token saved. Expires in:', json.session.expiresIn, 'seconds');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{accessToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"deviceCode\": \"{{deviceCode}}\",\n    \"pin\": \"{{devicePin}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/device/auth",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "device", "auth"]
            },
            "description": "Autentikasi dengan PIN untuk mendapatkan session token.\n\n**Kegunaan:** Mendapatkan akses kontrol device.\n\n**Session berlaku:** 5 menit\n\n**Auto-save:** Session token otomatis tersimpan ke collection variables."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Check Session Status",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{accessToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Device-Session",
                "value": "{{sessionToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/device/session/status",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "device", "session", "status"]
            },
            "description": "Mengecek apakah session masih valid.\n\n**Kegunaan:** Melihat sisa waktu session.\n\n**Return:**\n- valid: true/false\n- remainingTime: Detik tersisa\n- expiresAt: Waktu expired"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Extend Session",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{accessToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Device-Session",
                "value": "{{sessionToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/device/session/extend",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "device", "session", "extend"]
            },
            "description": "Memperpanjang session 5 menit lagi.\n\n**Kegunaan:** Perpanjang session tanpa perlu masukkan PIN.\n\n**Kapan digunakan:** Sebelum session expired jika masih butuh akses."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Send Control Command",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{accessToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Device-Session",
                "value": "{{sessionToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"targetTemperature\": 26.0,\n    \"targetHumidity\": 85.0,\n    \"fanSpeed\": 50,\n    \"heaterOn\": false,\n    \"action\": \"AUTO\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/device/control",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "device", "control"]
            },
            "description": "Mengirim perintah kontrol ke Arduino via WebSocket.\n\n**Kegunaan:** Mengontrol suhu target, kipas, heater, dll.\n\n**Parameter:**\n- targetTemperature: Target suhu (°C)\n- targetHumidity: Target kelembaban (%)\n- fanSpeed: Kecepatan kipas (0-100)\n- heaterOn: Nyalakan heater (true/false)\n- action: Mode (AUTO, MANUAL, OFF)"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Device Status",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{accessToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Device-Session",
                "value": "{{sessionToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/device/control/{{deviceCode}}/status",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "device", "control", "{{deviceCode}}", "status"]
            },
            "description": "Mendapatkan status terkini device.\n\n**Kegunaan:** Melihat informasi device dan sisa session."
          },
          "response": []
        },
